  "pages": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16520.png",
      "text": "Kabelo o entse hlanaphetho, moriri oa hae o molelele o thetsitse fatše. Lifate, joang, le tsohle ekare li shebile fatše.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:27d151ca7337ac15d3c4bd2af2680c17aaa45c63c360dad4fe0a048032ab916f"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16521.png",
      "text": "Maoto a hae, ekare a thetsitse leholimo. Bahla e monyane oa feta. O re, \"Nkile ka u bona. U entse hlanaphetho hape! Hobane'ng?\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:da50493307184b530c0e8aa873c6f07e0f87e413d7079d02182da104ed149f49"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16522.png",
      "text": "Maoto a hae a fofa moeeng habobebe. O leka ho ipata ka mora moriri. \"Ho th-th-th-thata ho b-b-b-bua,\" o cho joalo ho Bahla. \"Ha ke tšoane le pele.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:8043b9261fc1aa22d1a7719c34db998be95d8a0fe092bcadfddab13bd5c43ee5"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16523.png",
      "text": "Bahla o mo tšoara ka letsoho. O batla ho mo thusa ho utloisisa. Ba hloella sebakeng se hlahelletseng le lintho tse ngata seo Bahla a se ratang. Ba bona lintho tse ngata ha ba le holimo mono. Ba thotse ba shebelletse bana ba bapalang.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:b234c89733fe6824da2c507320da9e8b0cfc05ce47a68f5fc5311ffcbdb23c68"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16524.png",
      "text": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16525.png",
      "text": "Bana bao ha ba tšoane ho hang. Mohau o mochitja.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:005f8a6dd5194f235ec35362c287ad27f2f91404b7ca12f4a4702d6ca3869e22"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16526.png",
      "text": "Tebello o matheba-theba mahlong.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:c03eb05c431b2275e8df91af99db2fa4cc5db33e7095df65b74e266c3f184da9"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16527.png",
      "text": "Pitso o molelehali.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:510885f4362f01c6e4234e94e02382f6b2b3e48838aaf0afd48e855e91b9f317"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16528.png",
      "text": "Mosito o mafolofolo ebile o lokolohile.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:9b7066040743147bf413715698737586d82a5eb5c8db2a38fc3ad5124982665a"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16529.png",
      "text": "Ha Liketso eena a ipalla a thotse.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:b1db3c90d32c11e3b85134bff5c26885ea4c7bdd7b1d74f5a8d3bd0533499d5e"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16530.png",
      "text": "Bona moriri o mahlantholana oa Boitelo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=11",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:d32a8aaac680f14e9e1168e70624b9adac052c08b134bc71111e016c5537ed65"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16531.png",
      "text": "Bokang eena o lula a roetse likhalase tsa mahlo hohle moo a eang.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=12",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:6199247d6302f958fd76403450f476fc7005179b3dbba1d32ce0b818a4010e60"
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16532.png",
      "text": "'Me nna, ke moketanyana feela. Joalo ka uena. Ha u mong. Motho e mong le e mong o fapane, ua bona? Seo se etsa hore u ikhethe, joalo ka 'na. Lefatše lena ehlile ke papali e le 'ngoe e kholo. Hore re bapale, re ke se tšoane kaofela.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=13",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:81ddb9bba4647c4547e73256a63183fe6ebec39ef340c3ebc57b571795fe2c04"
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16533.png",
      "text": "Kabelo o ikutloa hantle, ka lebaka la motsoalle e mocha eo a mo fumaneng. Ho etsa hlanaphetho ho ne ho se monate. Hona joale o bapala le bana ba bang.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36356#page=14",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:2598acd964eabed247e461666193e6309dbf4777e388d2c471a60b243591ac29"
    }
  ],
